1
00:00:00,207 --> 00:00:01,917
(Howard:)Wrong pitcher.

2
00:00:07,214 --> 00:00:09,504
(Bernadette:)I told you I'm not good with kids.

3
00:00:09,675 --> 00:00:10,925
(Howard:)Yes, you did.

4
00:00:11,135 --> 00:00:13,805
(Howard:)I think my crotch is starting to curdle.

5
00:00:16,098 --> 00:00:18,518
(Bernadette:)The thing is,
my mother worked full-time.

6
00:00:18,684 --> 00:00:21,564
(Bernadette:)I had to take care of
my brothers and sisters.

7
00:00:21,729 --> 00:00:24,309
- Yeah, so?
- Uh, it was horrible.

8
00:00:24,523 --> 00:00:26,943
(Bernadette:)With their snotty noses
and their poopy diapers...

9
00:00:27,109 --> 00:00:29,739
(Bernadette:)...and their little shrieky voices,
always complaining.

10
00:00:29,903 --> 00:00:32,993
"l don't wanna get dressed."
"Joey keeps spitting in my mouth."

11
00:00:33,157 --> 00:00:35,037
"This isn't the way Mom
makes waffles."

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:39,000
(Bernadette:)Well, okay, put your hand in here.
Let's see how you like this waffle.

13
00:00:41,248 --> 00:00:44,668
(Howard:)All right, settle down.
Red light. Red light.

14
00:00:44,835 --> 00:00:48,295
Red light. Okay, we're fine.

15
00:00:49,798 --> 00:00:52,468
(Bernadette:)I'm sorry. I know it makes me
sound like a bad person...

16
00:00:52,634 --> 00:00:58,024
(Bernadette:)- ...but I just don't like children.
- Yeah, no, we all got that.

